  "worked_solution": "In the model, we have $\\frac{1}{2}$ on the left.\n\nSince we need to divide by $2$, we split the whole into $2$ equal parts horizontally. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129811/assets/55f483778924efcec7d8e47c0c580c3a2c1057d23b2a3ef172adf8b39ddfbd64.png)\n\nFrom the picture on the right, we obtain that the shaded part represents $\\frac{1}{4}$ of the whole.\n\nThe missing picture is:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129811/assets/6e06a98a14764d926db5dc09d5f1c7f9c2e74a1cd9f396164e6291206b53278d.png)",
